    "chunk_text": "agenne sunu Agothoclen & Antipater his a\u00feum. On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum Lisimachus sio burg besanc on eor\u00fean mid folce mid ealle. Ond \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Lisimachus h\u00e6fde swa wi\u00f0 his sunu gedon & wi\u00f0 his a\u00feum, \u00fea anscunedon \u00deagiet ne mehte se ni\u00f0 betux him tw\u00e6m gelicgean, \u00feeh heora na ma ne lifde \u00feara \u00fee Alexandres \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Lisimachus ofslagen. & \u00fe\u00e6s ymb \u00fereo niht com Ptolomeus, \u00fee Lisimahhus his sweostor h\u00e6fde, & diegellice \u00e6fter \u00dea w\u00e6s seo sibb & seo mildheortnes geendad \u00fee hie \u00e6t Alexandre geleornedon. \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t hie twegen \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r lengest lifdon h\u00e6fdon \u00feritig cyninga ofslagen heora agenra Gemong \u00fe\u00e6m gewinnum Lisimachus forlet his XV suna: sume he self ofslog, sume an \u00d0yllicne gebro\u00f0orscipe, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, hie heoldon him betweonum, \u00fee an anum hierede w\u00e6ron \u00de\u00e6tte hit is us nu swi\u00feor bismre gelic \u00fe\u00e6t we \u00fe\u00e6t bespreca\u00f0, & \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t we gewinn nu hata\u00f0, & her enda\u00f0 sio \u00feridde boc, & ongin\u00f0 seo feor\u00fee..",
